<title>CANADA: Tandem sells arm to Newbridge.</title>
<headline>Tandem sells arm to Newbridge.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newbridge Networks Corp said it intends to buy UB Networks, a subsidiary of Tandem Computers Inc, from Tandem.</p>
<p>No financial details were disclosed.</p>
<p>UB Networks is a company which links computers over a small area, which dovetails with Newbridge's networking products, Newbridge said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
